# Everything text is stored with LF, whatever the checkout platform. Without
# this, an editor on Windows that saves CRLF turns the next diff of that file
# into "every line changed" — which is what happened to the i18n dictionaries
# and to CreateRoom, and it hides the actual edit inside the noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: don't normalize them, don't try to diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
